OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRemaining
OL,6,Fmostly cloudy this evening, with any
OL,7,Frain gradually easing. The cloud
OL,8,Fbreaking in places overnight, to give
OL,9,Fsome clear and dry spells. The wind
OL,10,Feasing, but still feeling cool.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FCloudy with a few breaks to
OL,13,Fstart the day but largely dry. Cloud
OL,14,Fbuilding into the afternoon with a few
OL,15,Foutbreaks of light rain possible.
OL,16,FLight winds, near average temperatures.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
